Q: How to get the device token A: <p>Might be Late but also might be helpfull :)</p>

<p>Parse sometimes has some delays to when the done() method is called, I've seen it being called after I played around with the application for 3 minutes and exit it.</p>

<p>I used a different order for the method calls:</p>

<pre><code>Parse.initialize(this, "*******", "*******");

    ParsePush.subscribeInBackground("", new SaveCallback()
    {
        @Override
        public void done(ParseException e)
        {
            if (null == e)
            {
                ParseInstallation install = ParseInstallation.getCurrentInstallation();
                String token = install.getString("deviceToken");
                if (token != null)
